  "description": "On-device AI core for Circle. 1.5.0 adds upgrade-detection: UpgradeInfo record + UpgradeReason enum (VersionChanged / SHAChanged / Both / Unknown) + InstalledManifest record. ModelRegistryService.CheckForUpgradesAsync(storageDirectory) walks every installed model, compares the on-disk installed.json against the active registry (Version string + per-file SHA), and returns one UpgradeInfo per detected drift. Hosts subscribe via IAIObserver.OnUpgradeAvailableAsync — the SDK never auto-applies. Carries forward 1.4.0's catalog-driven SDK foundations: ModelScopeCatalogClient, signature verifier, DeviceProbe + DefaultDeviceContext, DeviceTierDefaults, capability + RAM + storage ranking on ModelEntry.",
